 <div  id="instrDiv"> 
  <p id="instruction" class="varTitle"><u><b data-translate>Instructions:</b></u></p>
  <ul id="instructionList">
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>1. Show 20 mL of water in the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>2. Drag and drop the dropper &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing 10 mL HCl into  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the measuring cylinder.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>3. Drag and drop the  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;measuring cylinder into a &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker containing water.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>4. Drag and drop the dropper  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing 4.5 mL &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;aniline&nbsp;into the measuring</br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; cylinder.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>5. Drag and drop the  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;measuring cylinder into the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker containing HCl and &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;water.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>6. Click the glass rod inside the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker to stir and get a &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;clear solution.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>7. Drag and drop the beaker  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;into the ice bath.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>8. Drag and drop the  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;thermometer into ice bath.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>9. Click on the Inference &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;button.</p></li>
        <li><p class="varTitle" data-translate>10.Click on the Next button.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
