<div  id="instrDivfig2"> 
  <p id="instructionfig2" class="varTitle"><u><b data-translate>Instructions:</b></u></p>
  <ul id="instructionListfig2">
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. Drag and drop the butter &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;paper containing 4 g sodium &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;nitrite powder in the beaker.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Click on the glass rod placed &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;in the beaker to stir &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;constantly.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Drag and drop the beaker &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;into the ice bath.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;4. Drag and drop the mixture  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;solution (HCl and aniline with  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;water) into the beaker &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing sodium nitrite &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;solution.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;5. Drag and drop glass rod into &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the solution beaker to stir.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;6. Drag and drop the dropper &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing 4 mL aniline into &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the measuring cylinder.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;7. Drag and drop the measuring &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;cylinder into the empty &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;8. Drag and drop the dropper &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing 4 mL HCl into the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;measuring cylinder.</p></li>
        <li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;9. Drag and drop the measuring &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;cylinder into the aniline &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;beaker.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;10.Drag benzene diazonium &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;chloride solution from &nbsp;5 <sup>o</sup>C &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ice bath and drop it in the HCl &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;and aniline beaker.</p></li></p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;11.Drag and drop glass rod into &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the solution beaker for &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;stirring to get a yellow color.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;12.Drag and drop the beaker &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;containing solution into the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ice bath.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;13.Click on the Inference &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;button.</p></li>
		<li><p class="varTitlefig2" data-translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;14.Click on the Next button.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
